  <Sequence sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="- Overview （畫面表格資料擷取）&#xA;Based on the input information, this function extracts the SAP table data from the general table inquiry screen and outputs the data.&#xA;The table search condition can be specified by Excel file (*. xlsx), data table, variant.&#xA;Output can be output with text data or output with table type data only for records displayed on the screen.&#xA;&#xA;- Input/Output&#xA;in_ArgumentFilePath as Argument File Path &lt;String&gt;&#xA;in_dt_SingleData as Set data table to input &lt;DataTable&gt;&#xA;in_dt_MultipleData  as When multiple conditions and inputs are DataTable &lt;Dictionary(Of String,DataTable)&gt;&#xA;out_dt_SearchResult  Output the output data table" DisplayName="SRC_CM_GET_TBL_E" sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="707,5674" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Sequence_429">
    <Sequence.Variables>
      <Variable x:TypeArguments="x:String" Default="SRC_CM_GET_TBL_E" Name="WorkflowName" />
      <Variable x:TypeArguments="scg:Dictionary(x:String, x:Object)" Default="[new Dictionary(of String, Object)]" Name="Config" />
      <Variable x:TypeArguments="x:String" Name="LogFileName" />
      <Variable x:TypeArguments="scg:Dictionary(x:String, x:String)" Name="Messages" />
    </Sequence.Variables>
    <sap:WorkflowViewStateService.ViewState>
      <scg:Dictionary x:TypeArguments="x:String, x:Object">
        <x:Boolean x:Key="IsExpanded">True</x:Boolean>
        <x:Boolean x:Key="IsAnnotationDocked">True</x:Boolean>
      </scg:Dictionary>
    </sap:WorkflowViewStateService.ViewState>
    <ui:Comment sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="（畫面表格資料擷取）&#xD;&#xA;Overview：「依輸入資訊，從SAP一般表格查詢畫面(SE16之類)擷取表格資料並輸出。查詢條件可用Excel檔、DataTable、或Variant(SAP查詢變式)指定。輸出可以是文字資料，或僅限畫面上顯示筆數的表格型資料。」&#xD;&#xA;&gt; 輸入：in_ArgumentFilePath、in_dt_SingleData(單一條件表)、in_dt_MultipleData(多條件字典)&#xD;&#xA;&gt; 輸出：out_dt_SearchResult&#xD;&#xA;&gt; 同樣走「讀參數→初始化Config→讀訊息檔→檢查參數→確認SAP GUI開啟」的標準初始化流程&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;📌 這是您之前問過的 SRC_BAPIv2.2_TABLEDATA_OUTPUT_E（用BAPI直接呼叫RFC_READ_TABLE）的**「畫面操作版」對應功能**——透過實際點擊SAP GUI畫面上的查詢畫面來撈資料，而不是走RFC後台呼叫。" sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="546,379" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Comment_1" Text="// Write your comments in the Text property">
